flowchart TD
    accTitle: Three kinds of evidence
    accDescr: The compiler checks compatible programs. Named tests check chosen behavior. Output comparisons check an entire visible transcript. Each answers a different question.
    A["TYPE CHECK<br/>Can these values fit together?"] --> B["NAMED TEST<br/>Does this case do what we promised?"]
    B --> C["OUTPUT COMPARISON<br/>Does the whole transcript match?"]
